1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,000
打开 NetworkConsole Lite，概览显示当前网络状态。
Open NetworkConsole Lite and review the current network status overview.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
切换到网络接口页，查看活动接口和 IP 地址。
Switch to Interfaces to see active interfaces and IP addresses.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,500
查看 DNS 解析器和默认路由。
Check the DNS resolver and default route.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
打开互联网连通性页，查看 Apple、Cloudflare 和 Google 的探测结果。
Open Internet Connectivity to review Apple, Cloudflare, and Google probe results.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
查看延迟和丢包近似，确认 9/9 探测成功。
Review latency and loss approximations with 9/9 probes succeeding.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
查看本地时间线中的检查和导出记录。
View local check and export history in the timeline.

7
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:38,000
打开设置，查看检测、自动巡检和隐私选项。
Open Settings to review probes, automatic checks, and privacy options.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,500
界面使用英文，可在设置中切换语言，并显示当前版本。
The UI stays in English, with language switching in Settings and the current version shown.

9
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:44,500
导出脱敏支持包，用于与支持人员分享。
Export a redacted support package to share with a helper.

10
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,800
演示结束，所有诊断数据都保存在本机。
Demo complete; all diagnostic data stays on this Mac.
